{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:af:schema:task-findings:2",
  "title": "Task findings af/task-findings@2",
  "$comment": "What `af task findings ID --json` prints (ADR-0211, ADR-0248): the Task's state, how many review rounds it recorded, the last (or `--round N`) round with every reviewer's findings — severity, confidence, title, location, quoted evidence, proposed fix and the agent prompt that hands the finding to the agent that will fix it — its counts by severity, what the round covered per reviewer and per path, the findings a verification record proved fixed on its Snapshot, and the evaluator's verdict. `round` is null when the Task recorded no round, `evaluation` when no evaluator recorded a verdict. Read-only.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema",
    "task_id",
    "state",
    "rounds",
    "round",
    "evaluation"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema": {
      "const": "af/task-findings@2"
    },
    "task_id": {
      "$ref": "urn:af:schema:task-contracts:1#/$defs/name"
    },
    "state": {
      "$ref": "urn:af:schema:task-state:1#/$defs/state"
    },
    "rounds": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 0,
      "maximum": 9007199254740991
    },
    "round": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/round"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ]
    },
    "evaluation": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/evaluation"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "finding": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "finding_id",
        "severity",
        "status",
        "confidence",
        "title",
        "file",
        "line",
        "evidence",
        "fix",
        "agent_prompt"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "finding_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "urn:af:schema:task-contracts:1#/$defs/digest"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "severity": {
          "enum": [
            "minor",
            "major",
            "blocker"
          ]
        },
        "status": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "confidence": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 65536,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        },
        "file": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 65536,
              "pattern": "\\S"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "line": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "evidence": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 65536,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        },
        "fix": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 65536,
              "pattern": "\\S"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "agent_prompt": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/agent_prompt"
        }
      },
      "$comment": "One finding as its reviewer reported it, with its agent prompt. `finding_id` and `status` are the Finding Set's, null for a report of an incomplete round. A `fixed` status is never a verified fix by itself: only `round.verified_fixed` names one."
    },
    "counts": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "blocker",
        "major",
        "minor"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "blocker": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "major": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "minor": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        }
      }
    },
    "reviewer": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "reviewer",
        "result_id",
        "findings"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "reviewer": {
          "$ref": "urn:af:schema:task-contracts:1#/$defs/name"
        },
        "result_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "urn:af:schema:task-contracts:1#/$defs/digest"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ]
        },
        "findings": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/finding"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "round": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "index",
        "round",
        "snapshot_id",
        "conclusion",
        "complete",
        "missing_reviewers",
        "counts",
        "reviewers",
        "coverage",
        "verified_fixed"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "index": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 9007199254740991
        },
        "round": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 16
        },
        "snapshot_id": {
          "$ref": "urn:af:schema:task-contracts:1#/$defs/digest"
        },
        "conclusion": {
          "enum": [
            "pass",
            "changes_requested",
            "convergence_exhausted",
            "incomplete"
          ]
        },
        "complete": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "missing_reviewers": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "urn:af:schema:task-contracts:1#/$defs/name"
          }
        },
        "counts": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/counts"
        },
        "reviewers": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/reviewer"
          }
        },
        "coverage": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/coverage"
        },
        "verified_fixed": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/verified_fix"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "evaluation": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "node",
        "artifact_id",
        "outcome",
        "reason"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "node": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 65536,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        },
        "artifact_id": {
          "$ref": "urn:af:schema:task-contracts:1#/$defs/digest"
        },
        "outcome": {
          "enum": [
            "passed",
            "failed",
            "inconclusive"
          ]
        },
        "reason": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 65536,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        }
      }
    },
    "agent_prompt": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "location",
        "evidence",
        "requested_change",
        "verification",
        "text"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "location": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "file",
            "line",
            "snapshot_id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "file": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 65536,
                  "pattern": "\\S"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "line": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            },
            "snapshot_id": {
              "$ref": "urn:af:schema:task-contracts:1#/$defs/digest"
            }
          }
        },
        "evidence": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 65536,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        },
        "requested_change": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 65536,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        },
        "verification": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 65536,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 65536,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        }
      },
      "$comment": "The finding handed to the agent that will fix it (ADR-0248): its location on the Snapshot the round reviewed (`file` and `line` null for a change-wide finding), the quoted evidence, the requested change (the reviewer's fix, or what is asked when it proposed none), how verification will judge a fix, and all of it as one prompt `text`."
    },
    "coverage": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "subject",
        "reviewers",
        "paths"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "subject": {
          "enum": [
            "diff",
            "whole_tree"
          ]
        },
        "reviewers": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "reviewer",
              "state",
              "reason"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "reviewer": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 4096,
                "pattern": "\\S"
              },
              "state": {
                "enum": [
                  "reviewed",
                  "not_run"
                ]
              },
              "reason": {
                "anyOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 65536,
                    "pattern": "\\S"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "state": {
                  "const": "not_run"
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "reason": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 65536,
                  "pattern": "\\S"
                }
              }
            },
            "else": {
              "properties": {
                "reason": {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "paths": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "path",
              "state"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "path": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 4096,
                "pattern": "\\S"
              },
              "state": {
                "enum": [
                  "reviewed",
                  "partially_reviewed",
                  "not_reviewed",
                  "outside_round"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "$comment": "What the round covered (ADR-0248). Each reviewer is `reviewed` (no findings from it means none found) or `not_run` with why (no findings from it means nothing). Each path of a diff round's Subject, then each path a finding names outside it (`outside_round`); a whole-tree round lists the paths its findings name. A path inside the round is `reviewed` when every reviewer ran, `partially_reviewed` when some did, `not_reviewed` when none did."
    },
    "verified_fix": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "finding_id",
        "record_id",
        "snapshot_id"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "finding_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 4096,
          "pattern": "\\S"
        },
        "record_id": {
          "$ref": "urn:af:schema:task-contracts:1#/$defs/digest"
        },
        "snapshot_id": {
          "$ref": "urn:af:schema:task-contracts:1#/$defs/digest"
        }
      },
      "$comment": "A finding verified fixed: the positive verification record that says so (an `af/TaskFixReceipt@1` on the Task path, a `FixVerification@1` on the Campaign path) and the Snapshot it was verified on. Nothing else is reported as verified fixed."
    }
  }
}
